{"id":"b43345226ad62970","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Update.md","title":"Update","display":"Update","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Update","parameters":["g","x","d","h"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Update"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>x</span><span>d</span><span>h</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：基础。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>x</code>、<code>d</code>、<code>h</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Update g x d h)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Fun g)\n  (and\n    (exists a\n      (exists b (and (@ Dom g a) (and (@ Single x b) (exists c (and (@ Union2 a b c) (@ FunDom h c)))))))\n    (forall y (forall z (iff (@ App h y z) (or (and (= y x) (= z d)) (and (not (= y x)) (@ App g y z))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"77a3b1b0b64f2abf\" href=\"?note=77a3b1b0b64f2abf\" title=\"ZFC_Dom\">Dom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eff666f032881d1b\" href=\"?note=eff666f032881d1b\" title=\"ZFC_Fun\">Fun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bdbfd129fa484068\" href=\"?note=bdbfd129fa484068\" title=\"ZFC_Single\">Single</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" href=\"?note=bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" title=\"ZFC_Union2\">Union2</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Update g x d h)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_Fun|Fun]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Dom","status":"resolved","id":"77a3b1b0b64f2abf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_Fun|Fun]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Fun","status":"resolved","id":"eff666f032881d1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_Fun|Fun]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FunDom","status":"resolved","id":"2fa14e4bd3447c97","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_Fun|Fun]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Single","status":"resolved","id":"bdbfd129fa484068","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading